{"c":[{"name":"20260912T163805Z-74c7fba4792433f6","text":"L4 per-milestone done, risks, and ticket refs must live in milestones.md or projectbrief.md: /niko Step 2a deletes tasks.md and progress.md before later milestones run.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T164808Z-b70c7feb534b80b1","text":"Preflight and QA stay spawnable skills with a one-line Run the skill bootstrap; they are not plan/build workflow routers. L2 and L3 share one preflight bar; L4 is a sibling reference inside niko-preflight.","type":"note"}]}
